    {
      "id": "mathematics-08-008",
      "number": 8,
      "question": "A certain sum of money triple itself in 10 years at simple interest. Find the rate of interest.",
      "options": {
        "A": "10%",
        "B": "15%",
        "C": "20%",
        "D": "25%"
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "SI = 2P. R = (2P * 100) / (P * 10) = 20%.",
      "hash": "d5b3ebe1133ec16d",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "कोई निश्चित राशि साधारण ब्याज पर 10 वर्षों में तिगुनी हो जाती है। ब्याज की दर ज्ञात कीजिए।",
          "options": {
            "A": "10%",
            "B": "15%",
            "C": "20%",
            "D": "25%"
          },
          "explanation": "SI = 2P. R = (2P * 100) / (P * 10) = 20%।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-08-009",
      "number": 9,
      "question": "Find the value of x: (2/3)x + 4 = (1/2)x + 6.",
      "options": {
        "A": "6",
        "B": "10",
        "C": "12",
        "D": "15"
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "(2/3 - 1/2)x = 2 => (1/6)x = 2 => x = 12.",
      "hash": "934cbb0f4abde981",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "x का मान ज्ञात करें: (2/3)x + 4 = (1/2)x + 6.",
          "options": {
            "A": "6",
            "B": "10",
            "C": "12",
            "D": "15"
          },
          "explanation": "(2/3 - 1/2)x = 2 => (1/6)x = 2 => x = 12."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-08-010",
      "number": 10,
      "question": "If the area of an equilateral triangle is 16*sqrt(3) sq.cm, find its perimeter.",
      "options": {
        "A": "12 cm",
        "B": "18 cm",
        "C": "24 cm",
        "D": "30 cm"
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "(sqrt(3)/4) * a^2 = 16*sqrt(3) => a^2 = 64 => a = 8. Perimeter = 3 * 8 = 24.",
      "hash": "9f404c5c8c34321c",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यदि एक समबाहु त्रिभुज का क्षेत्रफल 16*sqrt(3) वर्ग सेमी है, तो उसका परिमाप ज्ञात कीजिए।",
          "options": {
            "A": "12 सेमी",
            "B": "18 सेमी",
            "C": "24 सेमी",
            "D": "30 सेमी"
          },
          "explanation": "(sqrt(3)/4) * a^2 = 16*sqrt(3) => a^2 = 64 => a = 8। परिमाप = 3 * 8 = 24।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-08-011",
      "number": 11,
      "question": "If 3x = 5y and 4y = 7z, then x:z is?",
